    "background_story": "Jason was a skilled contractor with a passion for restoration. He spent years honing his craft, learning the intricacies of historic buildings and the art of bringing them back to life. One day, Jason landed a project to restore a century-old mansion, which had been ravaged by time and neglect. As he began to work on the walls, he realized that the original plaster was beyond repair. Undeterred, Jason decided to apply a skimcoat to the damaged areas, carefully layering on a thin coat of plaster to create a smooth surface. His patience and attention to detail paid off, as the walls began to transform before his eyes. The skimcoat not only restored the structural integrity but also revealed the hidden beauty of the original architecture. Jason's meticulous work earned him a reputation as a master restorer, and the mansion was reborn to its former glory.",
